OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks return called off due to
OL,4,Aforecast winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe return of a weekly beach fireworks
OL,7,Fdisplay that was suspended due to
OL,8,Fwildfire risks has been called off due
OL,9,Fto forecast high winds.
OL,11,FUnsafe conditions at sea mean it is not
OL,12,Fpossible to launch fireworks from a
OL,13,Fbarge off Bournemouth beach safely on
OL,14,FFriday night, Bournemouth, Christchurch
OL,15,Fand Poole (BCP) Council says.
OL,17,FThe local authority said an additional
OL,18,Fdisplay set for the following week on 4
OL,19,FSeptember would be a larger finale to
OL,20,Ffinish the summer season, with an
OL,21,Fadditional display also set for Poole
OL,22,FQuay on 3 September.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
